# Design system

Full spec: `.llm/design-system.md`. Home is the source of truth. Do not invent a second look for case studies.

**Brand:** whimsical, nature-forward, purple on white, floral photography, generous space.

## Tokens (`src/index.css`) — do not add new hex

- `--accent: #9350b2` headings, pills, CTAs
- `--text: #1c1917` / `--text-muted: #44403c` on light
- `--bg: #ffffff` / `--border: #e8e3dc`
- White type **only** on floral photos (`hero-bg.png`, `footer-bg.png`)

## Type

- DM Sans for all UI. Caveat **only** on the hero word “drawn”.
- Section + project titles: **700**, accent purple (48px / 32px on home).
- Do not copy case-study type (64px/400 titles, 15px body) — that drift is a bug.
- Style `.section-label` if you touch case studies: small uppercase, accent, letter-spacing. The class exists with **no CSS**.

## Layout to preserve

- Hero: text left, `manu-portfolio-pic.png` right (overlay is in the file).
- Cards: thumb left (natural screenshot ratio, ~15px radius) | title, desc, pills. “View website ↗” is a text link under the pills, never a tag.
- Home work: two sections — “Industry” then “Non Profit Organizations” — same heading + card style. Tesla is password-gated.
- Footer on home: floral photo, tagline left, Connect + Navigation right.
- Pills: 37px, accent border, `--accent-soft` fill.
